#
# The packages QualiLens depends on directly. requirements.txt is generated
# from this file: it pins every package, direct and indirect, with the
# SHA-256 hash of each file PyPI publishes for it, so pip installs nothing
# else and nothing altered (run.sh, CI). Edit this file, then regenerate:
#
#   uv pip compile backend/requirements.in --universal --python-version 3.11 \
#       --generate-hashes -o backend/requirements.txt
#
# --universal resolves one file for every Python from 3.11 and every platform.
